WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:20.000
JPM-CRED: Hey Diego, does the desk still run the auto issuer basis trade?

2
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Diego: We do, though we have trimmed it a bit over the last month. What size are you thinking?

3
00:00:40.000 --> 00:01:00.000
JPM-CRED: We have client interest in one hundred million, looking for a two-way.

4
00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:20.000
Diego: One hundred million is workable. Let me pull the current levels before I quote anything.

5
00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:40.000
JPM-CRED: Take your time, the client needs a level by tomorrow's open, not urgent today.

6
00:01:40.000 --> 00:02:00.000
Diego: Good, that gives me room to check inventory properly instead of rushing a number.

7
00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:20.000
JPM-CRED: Appreciated. Is there anything specific driving your trims recently?

8
00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:40.000
Diego: Mostly risk management, the basis had richened a lot and we took some profit.

9
00:02:40.000 --> 00:03:00.000
JPM-CRED: Makes sense, we saw similar richening reflected in a few other names too.

10
00:03:00.000 --> 00:03:20.000
Diego: Right, it has been a broad theme across the sector, not just this issuer.

11
00:03:20.000 --> 00:03:40.000
JPM-CRED: Understood. Should we expect a two-way with decent size on both legs?

12
00:03:40.000 --> 00:04:00.000
Diego: Likely yes, but I will confirm exact size tolerance once I check with risk.

13
00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:20.000
JPM-CRED: Sounds good, we will circle back tomorrow morning for the level.

14
00:04:20.000 --> 00:04:40.000
Diego: Perfect, I will have something ready before the open.

15
00:04:40.000 --> 00:05:00.000
JPM-CRED: Great, talk tomorrow.

16
00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:20.000
Diego: Talk tomorrow, thanks for the heads up on timing.
